  "notes": [
    "The proxy constructor selected the defect-bearing VerifierExit implementation; getTarget() returns 0xd12f4d8329584f36aed67f807f42d9a02beb9534 at the creation block and at blocks 15000000, 20000000 and 22881852, the proxy emitted no event in its entire life, and the UpgradeGatekeeper never emitted UpgradeComplete before the exploit.",
    "Reconstructed from receipts rather than taken from the reported headline. Netting every ERC20 Transfer of the ZKSwap L1 contract 0x8eca806aecc86ce90da803b080ca4e3a9b8097ad between blocks 22882059 and 22885419, plus its single outgoing internal transfer of 362.365589999999975424 ETH in 0x79fbdfad..., gives the 31 components listed. Three fabricated ZKS tokens (0xf0628ce987b7cf5d3687e1a7656fe37b556742de, 0x9017e2c072fea689b0201224f9ec6eccdbf6623b, 0x281e0115d1c613f59f5a90486551d65436e1241d) were deposited into the bridge in the same transactions that drained real assets, 26,000, 16,000 and 100,000,000,000 units respectively; they net exactly to zero and are excluded as attacker-supplied inputs. gZKS and the real ZKS token 0xe4815ae53b124e7263f08dcdbbb757d41ed658c6 are the project's own tokens and have no DefiLlama price series, and the wrapped-QTUM ERC20 has none either; those three carry quantity only, so the USD total is a lower bound on the full depletion. The priced components sum to 4,867,767.04 USD, which corroborates the 5 million USD figure Blockaid reported. Nothing was recovered.",
    "gZKS, the real ZKS token and the wrapped-QTUM ERC20 have no DefiLlama price series, so their exact quantities carry no USD value and the reported total is a lower bound on the full depletion.",
    "Re-anchored from 0x5488f6bbfabf7f1ada8e529c23dfc1fd129b4237536e9b5500b47d63f773e054 (block 22882195) to 0xfdb93e00f3b1d24303db7f43eaa5ef50d3fde957ddeec7c0feb8c5497ba11182 (block 22881853), the earliest successful transaction of the campaign that executes VerifierExit.verifyExitProof. The earlier anchor was the first transaction that proved fifteen exits at once; two single-exit proving transactions and the first 10,000 USDT withdrawal preceded it."
  ]
